   "title": "自定义列排序失效因表格缓存及配置未持久化",
   "type": "fact",
   "content": "Element UI `el-table` 仅调换 `v-for` 顺序时不重排列缓存，`displayColumns` 刷新后未从 `localStorage` 恢复且旧数据缺 `order` 字段致 `NaN` 排序。修复为在 `mixins/table.js` 增加 `tableColumnsKey` 并在 Vuex 空时从 `localStorage` 恢复，排序用 `(a.order ?? 0) - (b.order ?? 0)`，并在 `mixins/ListTemplate.js` 绑定 `:key` 重建表格。",
   "evidence": "extracted source=cursor session=23259f03-6ebe-4aaa-8a85-fd3a770bfa1b",
